{
  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 20,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.104,
            0.195,
            0.12
          ],
          "content": "TRIANGLES"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.872,
            0.104,
            0.899,
            0.118
          ],
          "content": "93"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.138,
            0.398,
            0.157
          ],
          "content": "Now, $BD = 1.2\\  m  \\times 4 = 4.8\\  m$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.164,
            0.412,
            0.182
          ],
          "content": "Note that in $\\Delta   \\mathrm { A B E }$ and $\\Delta   \\mathrm { C D E }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.415,
            0.189,
            0.901,
            0.246
          ],
          "content": "∠B = ∠D (Each is of $9 0 ^ { \\circ }$ because lamp-post as well as the girl are standing vertical to the ground)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.254,
            0.142,
            0.271
          ],
          "content": "and"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.418,
            0.252,
            0.899,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": "\\angle \\mathrm{E} = \\angle \\mathrm{E}\\tag{Same angle}",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.278,
            0.135,
            0.296
          ],
          "content": "So,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.39,
            0.277,
            0.565,
            0.296
          ],
          "content": "\\Delta   \\mathrm { A B E } \\sim \\Delta   \\mathrm { C D E }",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.668,
            0.277,
            0.9,
            0.297
          ],
          "content": "(AA similarity criterion)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.323,
            0.205,
            0.342
          ],
          "content": "Therefore,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.415,
            0.307,
            0.538,
            0.352
          ],
          "content": "\\left[ { \\frac { \\mathrm { B E } } { \\mathrm { D E } } }   =   { \\frac { \\mathrm { A B } } { \\mathrm { C D } } } \\right]",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_11.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.381,
            0.14,
            0.399
          ],
          "content": "i.e.,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.383,
            0.366,
            0.533,
            0.41
          ],
          "content": "\\left[ \\frac{4.8 + x}{x} = \\frac{3.6}{0.9} \\right]",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.646,
            0.367,
            0.9,
            0.409
          ],
          "content": "90\\  cm  = \\frac{90}{100}\\  m  = 0.9\\  m",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_14.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.418,
            0.139,
            0.436
          ],
          "content": "i.e.,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.392,
            0.417,
            0.522,
            0.436
          ],
          "content": "4 . 8 \\pm x = 4 x",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_16.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.443,
            0.139,
            0.462
          ],
          "content": "i.e.,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.442,
            0.527,
            0.462
          ],
          "content": "3x = .4.8",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_18.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.468,
            0.14,
            0.486
          ],
          "content": "i.e.,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.445,
            0.468,
            0.526,
            0.487
          ],
          "content": "x \\equiv 1 . 6",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_20.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.494,
            0.745,
            0.513
          ],
          "content": "So, the shadow of the girl after walking for 4 seconds is 1.6 m long."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.525,
            0.55,
            0.583
          ],
          "content": "**Example 8 :** In Fig. 6.33, CM and RN are respectively the medians of $\\Delta$ ABC and $\\Delta$ PQR. If $\\Delta  ABC  \\sim \\Delta  PQR$ , prove that :"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.588,
            0.329,
            0.607
          ],
          "content": "(i) $\\Delta   \\mathrm { A M C } \\sim \\Delta   \\mathrm { P N R }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.622,
            0.266,
            0.663
          ],
          "content": "(ii) $\\frac { \\mathrm { C M } } { \\mathrm { R N } }   =   \\frac { \\mathrm { A B } } { \\mathrm { P Q } }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.529,
            0.52,
            0.9,
            0.682
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_20_image_25.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.674,
            0.332,
            0.693
          ],
          "content": "(iii) $\\Delta \\mathrm { C M B } \\sim \\Delta \\mathrm { R N Q }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.699,
            0.232,
            0.718
          ],
          "content": "**Solution :** (i)"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.316,
            0.699,
            0.492,
            0.718
          ],
          "content": "\\Delta  ABC  \\sim \\Delta  PQR",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_28.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.664,
            0.689,
            0.764,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": "Fig. 6.33"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.822,
            0.7,
            0.897,
            0.718
          ],
          "content": "(Given)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.747,
            0.135,
            0.765
          ],
          "content": "So,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.344,
            0.731,
            0.896,
            0.774
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{\\mathrm{AB}}{\\mathrm{PQ}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{BC}}{\\mathrm{QR}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{CA}}{\\mathrm{RP}}\\tag{1}",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_32.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.967,
            0.564,
            0.982
          ],
          "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.786,
            0.14,
            0.803
          ],
          "content": "and"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.301,
            0.785,
            0.685,
            0.803
          ],
          "content": "\\angle \\mathrm{A} = \\angle \\mathrm{P}, \\angle \\mathrm{B} = \\angle \\mathrm{Q}   and   \\angle \\mathrm{C} = \\angle \\mathrm{R}",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_35.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.811,
            0.141,
            0.827
          ],
          "content": "But"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.352,
            0.786,
            0.896,
            0.828
          ],
          "content": "AB = 2\\  AM \\  and \\  PQ  = 2\\  PN\\tag{2}",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_37.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.602,
            0.829,
            0.898,
            0.847
          ],
          "content": "(As CM and RN are medians)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.872,
            0.224,
            0.891
          ],
          "content": "So, from (1),"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.325,
            0.856,
            0.465,
            0.899
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{2 AM }{2 PN } = \\frac{ CA }{ RP }",
          "image_source": "images/page_20_equation_40.jpg"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
